<title>USA: Park Bancorp buyback plan wins approval.</title>
<headline>Park Bancorp buyback plan wins approval.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Park Bancorp Inc said Wednesday its board authorized and the Department of Treasury, Office of Thrift Supervision has approved a plan for the company to buy back up to 10 percent of 270,144 shares over the next six months.</p>
<p>The holding company for Park Federal Savings Bank now has 2.7 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Stock repurchased under the program will be made in open market or negotiated transactions. The stock will be used to fulfill the company's obligations under its stock-based incentive plan.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
